    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af000282d123f005dd46d8bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过现在离“樱花赏”还有一段时间，\n我想另外设定一个比较近期的目标竞赛。\n如果要说最理想的选择……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa932828ae152269cd59b350eed945aea83aefe4f91f2353e812da862b3dfefb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
